Author:     Burak Emre Kabakcı <emrekabakci@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Sun Aug 16 20:19:52 2026 +0100
Commit:     Burak Emre Kabakcı <emrekabakci@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Sun Aug 16 20:20:02 2026 +0100

    feat(server): classify authorization-bearing relationship types

    Ships the mechanism inert: the chokepoint trigger only fires for a type whose
    purpose is 'authorization', and nothing is classified yet. A follow-up deploy
    flips ensureMemberOfType and backfills, by which point every live pod already
    sets the transaction-local flag.

